  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP TL implement together with the PDHJ the project &quot;Capacity        Development for the Provedoria for HR and Justice&quot;.Expected to        contribute to improved inst capacity of the PDHJ;Improved capacity,   strengthened HR mandate of the PDHJ,the effectiveness of the          institution&apos;s outreach to the Timorese population, includ vulnerable  groups by strengthening the district offices, cs and local level.</narrative>
